First, I'll break down the sentence into smaller parts to understand each component:
- "pero" (but)
- "la matemática básica" (basic math)
- "explica" (explains)
- "tanto" (both)
- "la pendiente empinada" (the steep slope)
- "como" (as)
- "la cola larga y chata" (the long and flat tail)

Next, I'll translate each part into Hebrew:
- "pero" → "אבל" (Avil)
- "la matemática básica" → "המתמטיקה הבסיסית" (Hamatematekha Habasitit)
- "explica" → "מסבירה" (Mosevira)
- "tanto" → "גם" (Gam)
- "la pendiente empinada" → "המדרון המائل" (Hamadaron Hamo'el)
- "como" → "כמו" (Kamo)
- "la cola larga y chata" → "הזנב הארוך והשטוח" (Hazanav Harokh Vashatukh)

Putting it all together, the translated sentence is:
"אבל המתמטיקה הבסיסית מסבירה גם את המדרון המائل, כמו הזנב הארוך והשטוח."

